WEBVTT

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.660
You know, it's a lot easier to move around

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:10.860
in this guy's uniform.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.620
Is anyone here?

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.780
Oh, Student Council President.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.250
Where are the club members?

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.600
I'm the only one to arrive so far.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.660
You're...

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.330
the new member of this 
club, aren't you?

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:26.900
Y-Yeah, I am...

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:28.910
Too bad for you.

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:30.540
This club's getting shut down today.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:31.260
What?!

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.660
What's this song?

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:40.930
Creepy Time-Space, go forth!

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:42.820
Jump!

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:43.430
Huh?

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:50.820
Astronomy Police Inspector Kyouder!

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:34.040
<b>Aim for the Stars!</b>

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:34.040
<b>The Girl that Dreams of Love</b>

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:36.380
Young lad,

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:38.860
why are you wearing male clothing?!

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:41.510
Are you having a wonderful 
time growing up?!

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:44.530
You're not hiding who you really 
are at heart, are you?!

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:45.600
Now, strip!

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.300
Strip this moment and 
expose your true self!

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:48.930
Huh?

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:51.450
Itsuki-sama?!

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:56.280
Elizabeth, you came to save me!

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:01.500
I'm your maid, so it's my job 
to be the one to strip you!

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:02.590
What?

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:04.200
Move out of the way, Onee-sama!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.340
How dare you?! That's mine! Anger!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:11.970
Stop!

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:21.790
Look what you did!

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:25.900
This costume was expensive 
because it was plated!

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.470
Oh,

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.890
you all seem to be having a good time.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.480
Vice-President...

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.770
This is bad.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.570
The student council 
president is here saying

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:36.150
the Astronomy Club is 
going to be shut down.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.690
Oh, club president Iseda,

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:41.460
so you've returned to 
the Astronomy Club?

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:42.910
Huh? Club president?

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.780
I've already quit this club!

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:48.200
Oh? I haven't received any 
papers to that effect.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.180
Th-The student council did!

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:52.210
I don't have anything to 
do with this club anymore!

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.250
Wh-What's going on?

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:57.570
Iseda-senpai was a member of 
this club up until last year.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.500
What?

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:00.590
But it seems like something happened

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.130
between her and Ooba-senpai.

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.340
Anyway, you guys don't 
have any real activities,

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.010
so I can't let you be!

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.330
Student Council President Iseda!

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:13.060
Before suggesting that the 
club needs to be shut down,

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.120
isn't there a need to verify whether

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:18.000
or not we really are providing 
acceptable activities?

00:04:18.450 --> 00:04:20.000
Verify?

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.440
In short,

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.610
how about you join us for 
a little star-gazing?

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:31.660
Hi there, all you good kids!

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:35.930
It's time for the "Astronomy 
Police Inspector Kyouder" show!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.960
Here's lunch.

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.910
I'm having a lot of trouble.

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:45.510
He wasn't chosen for the 
nursery school I'd wanted.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.470
Mine, either.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.780
I'm Astronomy Police Inspector Kyouder!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.850
And this is my assistant.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.290
Um...

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:55.850
<b>Female Astronomy Detective 
Honey</b>

00:04:57.140 --> 00:04:59.540
Female Astronomy Detective, Honey.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:02.300
I ended up being forced to 
dress up like a girl again.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:06.450
<b>Don't say that!!</b>

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:07.770
How is this star-gazing?

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:10.450
The Astronomy Club is just messing 
around putting on a hero skit.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.470
They should get shut down.

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:17.210
Yes, but you can't actually 
star-gaze unless it's dark.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.150
That's why I invited you 
to go on the ferris wheel,

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:23.880
so that we can be together 
until it becomes dark.

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:31.560
Also, all of the kids are having fun.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.800
No... They don't look 
like they're having fun.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:37.100
They don't even look 
like they're watching.

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:40.230
It reminds you of your childhood

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:43.270
when you watch them 
playing around like that.

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:45.990
Huh? W-Wait, I don't see how you can

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.910
really go to a flashback there.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.310
I can see it now... Ten years ago...

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:51.750
Hey!

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:55.230
Yay! Yay! Hehe! Hasuo-san!

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:56.500
Come here!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.500
Try to catch me!

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:02.380
Yay! Yay! Hehe! Hasuo-san!

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:04.340
Wa-Wait, Yuka-chan.

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:08.010
Oh, sorry, Hasumi-chan.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:10.210
I was too busy playing the "stupid, happy,

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:12.780
outdated couple you couldn't 
find anywhere anymore" game.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:13.950
Are you okay?

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:15.720
Do you want to rest a little.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:16.640
Oh?

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:18.020
What's wrong?

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:23.050
I smell something good.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.250
Hey, I do, too.

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:46.030
That's a big house.

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:50.790
The good smell is coming 
from this direction.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.580
H-Hey, you can't—

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:53.470
Why?

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.020
What if there's a ghost or something?

00:06:57.230 --> 00:07:00.260
You're always such a 
scaredy cat, Yuka-chan.

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:03.570
Th-That's not true!

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:08.750
Wow, this is pretty.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:13.300
There's a lot of roses.

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.830
Wow...

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.530
A telescope?

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:20.080
Want to take a peek?

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:22.670
We're gonna get in trouble.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.000
Who's there?

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:33.510
Oh my, such cute visitors.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:34.930
U-Uh...

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:37.140
S-Sorry for coming in 
without permission.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.390
Sorry.

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:42.270
Stars and roses...

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:43.460
Huh?

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:44.960
Which do you like better?

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:47.220
Um...

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:53.740
We like both of them!

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.550
What a coincidence. Me, too.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:00.860
You look through the telescope?

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:04.880
Yes, I can't go out and walk very much,

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:08.680
so watching the stars from here
was one of my favorite pastimes,

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:11.910
but lately I haven't been able to

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:14.790
use the telescope for 
long periods of time.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:16.260
I see.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.420
I'd like to keep this small rose garden...

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:21.890
My husband quite liked it.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.670
But I'm not sure how long 
I can keep it maintained.

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:26.600
Hey, Hasumi-chan.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:28.650
Listen...

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:34.630
D-Do you...

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.500
Think we could come again?

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.280
If you don't mind.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.040
That would be wonderful.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.310
And then, and then,

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:45.150
we'd find stars for you, and help you

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:47.010
take care of the flowers.

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:48.450
Oh my.

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:55.090
Yuka-chan, I'll help out.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:58.390
No, it's okay. You've got a 
fragile body, Hasumi-chan.

00:08:58.390 --> 00:08:59.720
Just rest over there.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:01.020
But...

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:04.700
Then look up stuff about stars for me.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.470
You're pretty smart, 
so you can help there.

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:08.170
Okay. Got it.

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:27.800
Let's see...

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.370
That's Capella.

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:31.970
No, Capella's further up.

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:33.880
That's Aldebaran.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:35.240
Uh...

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:38.160
Oh, you're right. You're 
good at this, Hasumi-chan.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:44.430
It's been about four years 
since you started coming here.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:47.770
You've learned a lot about the stars.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:56.180
You can see the stars well tonight.

00:09:57.810 --> 00:10:00.020
They're really pretty.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:01.700
Yeah.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:06.590
Have you heard of the Rosette Nebula?

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:07.920
Rosette Nebula?

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:12.340
Yes, you can't see it with a 
small telescope like this one,

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:17.360
but it's red and pretty 
like the roses here.

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:19.250
The Rosette Nebula, huh?

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:24.180
I've always wanted to see it once.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.220
You'll be able to.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:25.980
Huh?

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.760
We'll take a picture 
of the nebula for you.

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:31.440
That's a good idea.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.680
If it's a picture, you can 
put it up, and look at it

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:35.300
at any time you want.

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:36.040
But...

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:39.450
How do we take a picture?

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:50.410
Have you forgotten already?

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:52.410
I...

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:02.570
Creepy Time-Space, go forth!

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:05.280
<b>Creepy Monster Nukonuko</b>

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:04.080
Nukonuko.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:09.270
I'm going to "nuko" all the kids.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:12.320
I was going to try the cat-diet.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:12.800
Nuko, be afraid.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:13.770
It's great.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.770
U-Um...

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:19.460
Oh no, Kyouder!

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:22.200
The Creepy Monster Nukonuko is here!

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.860
All right! Equip!

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:28.630
Astronomy Police Inspector Kyouder

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:32.150
can equip her suit in a 
mere 0.1 microsecond.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.500
Let me explain how it works!

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.760
Where did this go again?

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:40.800
Oh, that's the left arm.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.270
Isn't this supposed to go on her legs?

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:43.800
That's for her chest.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.550
While her suit is being equipped,

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.810
how about we go to commercial?

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:50.060
This is cool!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:59.070
<b>Oomori Shouko's "For the Hell of It" Covers</b>

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:59.070
How's Oomori-sensei 
(the person) today?

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:13.820
Cr-Creepy. Cr-Creepy. Creepy.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:24.830
Cr-Creepy. Cr-Creepy. Creepy.

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.220
Recording Voicemail

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:27.720
Messages 
144

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:30.470
Incoming Call... 
Oomori Shouko

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:41.150
Astronomy Police Inspector!

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:45.660
Kyouder!

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:54.300
So you've shown yourself, Kyouder!

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.590
I hear people are doing 
cat-stretches lately.

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:56.690
Really?

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:59.260
Creepy Monster, Nukonuko. Do it!

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:00.300
Nukonuko!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:01.220
All right!

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:03.300
Female Astronomy Detective Honey, let's go!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.920
Huh? Me?

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:06.550
Let's go!

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:08.850
Nuko!

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:19.510
What a terrifying attack.

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:22.000
Female Astronomy Detective Honey 
has died in the line of action!

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:23.720
Nukonukonuko.

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:31.330
K-Kyouder... You wanna nuko it up?

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:33.120
What? You pervert!

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.710
Astronomy blade!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.310
Red Flash!

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:40.160
Huh?

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.620
It's not lighting up.

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:43.840
Nukonuko.

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.160
Red Flash!

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.680
Red Flash!

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:02.500
Wow, these special effects are great!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:04.780
No, the building's actually 
on fire, you know?!

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:07.530
It's kinda hot today.

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.410
I guess it's one of 
those warm autumn days.

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.030
No way!

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:20.930
Okay, that was close.

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:22.920
We were almost arrested.

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.550
I thought I was going to die.

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:28.950
That's because you're messing 
around playing hero.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:30.300
We're not playing!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.560
It was a proper show.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:36.610
Oh, club president Iseda,

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:37.830
are you scared?

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:38.580
Huh?

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:41.460
L-Like I'd be scared.

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:43.270
I was just showing my enthusiasm!

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:45.650
So why are we carrying around

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.030
scary-looking red flashlights, anyway?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.580
It's so our eyes get used to the dark.

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.200
Normal flashlights aren't good

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.800
when you're trying to look at the stars.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:57.960
I see.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.490
You sure know a lot about this stuff.

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:02.080
Makes sense you were club president.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.980
I told you to stop that!

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:11.890
Sorry, I forgot the Astronomy 
Police Inspector outfit.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.810
Don't try to scare me, you klutz!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.990
Seems that Neko-sensei is cold.

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:20.640
Well, you're giving me the chills!

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:22.690
Speaking of giving you the chills...

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:24.520
There was this one story about a

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.610
red face looking back up at you when

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:29.990
you squat over one of those 
old-style Japanese toilets.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.980
I heard a story about a doujinshi author

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:36.570
who pushed himself so hard 
trying to make a deadline,

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:39.720
ended up in the hospital. 
But he was a sales clerk at an exhibition.

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:44.740
So you are scared.

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:49.160
Neko-sensei.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:54.970
Iseda-senpai.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.530
What is it?!

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:57.850
You have something else?!

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:01.260
No, if you haven't noticed, 
it's fine, but...

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:06.980
Looks like there's something next 
to the tree, where you are.

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:12.860
I've had enough!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.620
Club president Iseda.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:23.330
Somebody!

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.880
Where am...

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:30.650
Where am I?

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:36.780
Club president?

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:38.970
Hasumi?

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.980
You're as scared as ever.

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:42.730
N-Not really!

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:46.440
But for you to run here 
without realizing it...

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:48.470
I guess you remember

00:16:48.470 --> 00:16:50.860
the way no matter how 
many years it's been.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:52.450
The way?

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:57.970
See?

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:01.540
I borrowed quite a few.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:04.040
I hope she likes them.

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:06.800
I'm sure she will.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.320
It was so sudden.

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.440
But she was quite old.

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.750
What's going on?

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:15.650
Yeah...

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:18.850
Who are you?

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:24.120
O-Oh, we're running errands 
for the lady here...

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:27.190
We help take care of the roses, 
and star-gaze with her.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:29.390
Oh, I see.

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:34.030
Thank you.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:37.790
But your services will 
no longer be needed.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:48.660
Thank you for everything.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:17:59.970
Hey, Hasumi!

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.490
I wonder where Hasumi is...

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:13.730
We finally were able to officially

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:16.490
get the room for the Astronomy Club.

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.380
There she is.

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:21.670
They finished it.

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:22.960
Pretty cool, isn't it?

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:27.970
Hasumi?

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:50.980
So we're going to star-gaze here?

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:52.240
That's right.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:54.460
That was my plan all along.

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:57.490
What's in here, anyway...

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:01.740
Unfortunately, we can't be 
using my Dob today, but...

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:07.500
Wh-Where did you get something 
so expensive-looking?

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:08.980
Did you steal it?

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:10.970
Everyone's upset about the fire,

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:14.000
but good thing we got payment 
for the job upfront.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.790
That hero show...

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:19.170
Do you think we were just 
doing that for fun?

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:22.050
The student council is 
rather tough on us,

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:24.560
so we can't get the equipment we need,

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.770
so we work on the side.

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:28.450
So this is...

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:30.440
Yes, we rented it.

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:34.540
Can you really use proper 
equipment like this?

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:36.440
Who do you think I am?

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:39.950
I could use the Hubble Space 
Telescope if I wanted to.

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:42.580
Anyway, what picture 
should we take first?

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:46.450
I already decided what 
we're taking first.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.360
Really?

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.220
I see.

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:58.460
Right now...

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:00.280
We should be looking in that direction.

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.570
I'm glad.

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:04.880
So we move this over here.

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:07.530
I think that should be over here.

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:10.100
Oh, you're right. So...

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.680
Think you can get a good picture?

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:13.960
Who do you think I am?

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:16.410
Yes, yes, you can use 
everything, right?

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:17.850
Come on.

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:20.520
See? Piece of cake.

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:22.580
Wow, that was cool!

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:23.960
What do you think, Vice-President?

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:26.250
Wonderful. Thank you, Todayama-san.

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:28.560
Told you!

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.350
Club president Iseda.

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:37.000
Want to see the picture we just took?

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.670
H-Huh? Why would I...

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:40.730
Here you go.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:42.800
What is this?

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:48.350
NGC 2237, also known 
as the Rosette Nebula.

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:53.260
We'll take a picture 
of the nebula for you.

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:55.100
That's a good idea.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:57.350
If it's a picture, you can put it up,

00:20:57.350 --> 00:20:59.040
and look at it at any time you want.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.970
So you didn't forget...

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:08.640
Of course not.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:11.930
But I was able to do this 
because Todayama-san and

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:11.560
What should we shoot next?

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:13.120
The Cat Nebula.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:13.120
the others were there to help me out.

00:21:13.990 --> 00:21:15.500
There's nothing like that.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:16.720
You never know.

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:18.050
We might stumble upon one.

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:20.000
Then make one yourself.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.950
You guys are never serious.

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:25.580
<i>I see... I just misunderstood.</i>

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:37.400
Club president?

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:41.770
Anyway, I understand now that you are

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:45.030
providing proper activities 
for the Astronomy Club.

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:47.300
So does that mean the request to

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:49.030
shut down the club will be rescinded?

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:52.130
Y-Yeah, for today, anyway.

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:55.040
That's enough for me.

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:14.290
Oh, that looks like a guitar.

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:15.600
The Guitar Nebula?

00:22:18.790 --> 00:22:20.340
I...

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:24.440
think I want to play guitar now!

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:27.260
You're shutting down the 
Astronomy Club, right?

00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:29.840
Well, not really...

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:32.610
Then we should start up a light 
music club starting tomorrow!

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:33.790
What?!

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:38.420
Oh, A plane traveling to England...

00:22:39.460 --> 00:22:43.060
It looks like a C130 that's going 
to land at Iruma Air Base to me.

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:45.230
Let's start up a band 
and go to England!

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:46.460
What?!

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:48.130
Are you sure we can do that?

00:22:48.490 --> 00:22:50.550
OSCAR!

00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:52.130
That's France...

00:22:52.130 --> 00:22:54.490
ADRIAN!

00:22:54.490 --> 00:22:56.660
That's America...

00:24:31.560 --> 00:24:33.030
It's Neko-sensei!

00:24:33.030 --> 00:24:34.370
Neko-sensei turns into a robot!

00:24:33.800 --> 00:24:34.340
<b>Amazing Build Quality</b>

00:24:34.370 --> 00:24:35.200
Into a bike!

00:24:35.200 --> 00:24:36.780
Three amazing forms!

00:24:35.510 --> 00:24:36.620
<b>Three Amazing Forms</b>

00:24:36.780 --> 00:24:39.550
Neko-sensei Deluxe is here!

00:24:38.120 --> 00:24:40.720
Next time: 
"Viva Astronomy" Look forward to it!

00:24:38.310 --> 00:24:40.360
<b>Neko-sensei Deluxe is here!</b>
